<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-5789] Update Dockerfile to use JDK instead of JRE</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5789</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Update Dockerfile to use JDK instead of JRE.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Fixes issues such as trying to add a new interpreter belonging to &quot;jdbc&quot; group having hive-jdbc conf results in missing dependencies (tools.jar) and such.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;PR #2536 here &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/2536&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/2536&lt;/a&gt; replaced Oracle with OpenJDK but then commit &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/commit/b1adb5a23a9c9e23d8527edbaa260cb70587d81b&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/commit/b1adb5a23a9c9e23d8527edbaa260cb70587d81b&lt;/a&gt; switched to JRE.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
